yle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6rov6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Bordering on true fine dining, this farm to table meal was a wonderful experience in local food and wine, well prepared and beautiful. The ambiance is cozy and upscale casual. The interior is full of warm wood and white linen and the servers are knowledgeable and attentive without hovering. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9fog9","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"csmfu","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"93vvd","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dse72","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"I had the fresh fish and my husband had braised lamb shank. Needless to say, everything was delicious! The chefs at Higgins have a passion for organic locally grown ingredients and it really shows in their fresh and artistic presentation.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"kceo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"erhj6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"We started the meal with a charcuterie board that was beautifully prepared, artful and yummy! We were hungry and jumped all over it so fast I didn't even get a picture. Sorry, what wa